{"id": "85baff1a-6165-4c93-865e-9e8b72fcb796", "slug": "novus-capital-solutions-hero", "title": "Novus | Capital Solutions Hero", "description": "Novus Capital Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Novus | Capital Solutions Hero\"\ndescription: \"Novus Capital Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D4F849\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#D4F849\"\n  background: \"#B0AD9E\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#B0AD9E\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"31px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Novus | Capital Solutions Hero\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 67; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, charts, billing, support.\n## Overview\nNovus Capital Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nNovus Engine v2.0 The Ultimate Engine for Enterprise Growth Deploy predictive neural models and structural capital solutions—all within one intelligent, terminal-grade framework designed for absolute precision. Start Ap…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Ultimate Engine for Enterprise Growth.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D4F849, secondary #000000, accent #D4F849, background #B0AD9E, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Novus | Capital Solutions Hero</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#b0ad9e] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 font-sans antialiased text-gray-900 selection:bg-[#d4f849] selection:text-[#151715] overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Hero Section Container -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1100px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column: Copy & Metrics -->\n        <article class=\"lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10\">\n            \n            <!-- System Label Pill -->\n            <div class=\"reveal-element inline-flex items-center self-start gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f8f9f5] border border-black/5 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] mb-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); filter: blur(4px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#d4f849] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(212,248,73,0.8)]\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-gray-600 uppercase\">Novus Engine v2.0</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"split-text text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] mb-6\">\n                The Ultimate Engine for Enterprise Growth\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"split-text text-base md:text-lg font-light text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-lg mb-10\">\n                Deploy predictive neural models and structural capital solutions—all within one intelligent, terminal-grade framework designed for absolute precision.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"reveal-element flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); filter: blur(4px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 200ms;\">\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#151715] text-[#d4f849] flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] hover:bg-black transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Start Application</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/30 text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-white/30 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-normal\">View Documentation</span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Custom User Prompt Metrics (Vertically Aligned Center) -->\n            <div class=\"reveal-element flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-900/10\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); filter: blur(4px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 400ms;\">\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex -space-x-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#f8f9f5] border border-[#b0ad9e] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#151715] border border-[#b0ad9e] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-[#d4f849] text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-800\">24k+ Active learners enrolled</div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"hidden sm:block w-px h-6 bg-gray-900/15\"></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-gray-900 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-800\">92% Average completion</div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- Right Column: Visual ThreeJS Surface -->\n        <article class=\"lg:col-span-6 w-full relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end\">\n            <!-- Premium Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"reveal-element relative w-full max-w-[500px] aspect-[4/5] rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/40 via-white/5 to-black/20 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); filter: blur(8px); transition: all 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 150ms;\">\n                \n                <!-- Deep Charcoal Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-[31px] bg-[#151715] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Top Bar -->\n                    <header class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center w-full p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#1e2311] border border-[#d4f849]/20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-update-linear\" class=\"text-[#d4f849] text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/40 tracking-wide\">system.core.active</span>\n                    </header>\n\n                    <!-- ThreeJS Canvas Mount -->\n                    <div id=\"hero-three-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-90 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Glassy UI Element for Density -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-6 mx-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/50 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Compute Load</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end gap-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white tracking-tight leading-none\">98.4%</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-[#d4f849] pb-0.5\">Optimized</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pulse-linear\" class=\"text-white/80 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // 1. Intersect Observer for standard reveals without CSS classes\n            const observerOptions = { root: null, rootMargin: '0px', threshold: 0.1 };\n            \n            const elementObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                entries.forEach(entry => {\n                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                        entry.target.style.opacity = '1';\n                        entry.target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                        entry.target.style.filter = 'blur(0)';\n                        elementObserver.unobserve(entry.target);\n                    }\n                });\n            }, observerOptions);\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-element').forEach(el => {\n                elementObserver.observe(el);\n            });\n\n            // 2. Word-by-word text splitting and animation setup\n            const textObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                entries.forEach(entry => {\n                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                        const spans = entry.target.querySelectorAll('span.word-span');\n                        spans.forEach((span, index) => {\n                            setTimeout(() => {\n                                span.style.opacity = '1';\n                                span.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                                span.style.filter = 'blur(0px)';\n                            }, index * 60 + 100);\n                        });\n                        textObserver.unobserve(entry.target);\n                    }\n                });\n            }, observerOptions);\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.split-text').forEach(el => {\n                const walker = document.createTreeWalker(el, NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT, null, false);\n                const textNodes = [];\n                let node;\n                while(node = walker.nextNode()) {\n                    if(node.nodeValue.trim() !== '') textNodes.push(node);\n                }\n\n                textNodes.forEach(textNode => {\n                    const words = textNode.nodeValue.split(/(\\s+)/); // Preserve spaces\n                    const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                        if (word.trim() === '') {\n                            fragment.appendChild(document.createTextNode(word));\n                        } else {\n                            const span = document.createElement('span');\n                            span.textContent = word;\n                            span.className = 'word-span';\n                            // Inline styles for base state\n                            span.style.cssText = 'opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); filter: blur(3px); transition: all 800ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); display: inline-block;';\n                            fragment.appendChild(span);\n                        }\n                    });\n                    textNode.parentNode.replaceChild(fragment, textNode);\n                });\n\n                textObserver.observe(el);\n            });\n\n            // 3. ThreeJS Isometric System Initialization\n            function initThreeJS() {\n                const container = document.getElementById('hero-three-canvas');\n                if (!container || typeof THREE === 'undefined') return;\n\n                const width = container.clientWidth;\n                const height = container.clientHeight;\n                const aspect = width / height;\n                const d = 12; // Frustum scale\n\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-d * aspect, d * aspect, d, -d, 1, 1000);\n                camera.position.set(20, 20, 20); // Strict Isometric\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                const group = new THREE.Group();\n                scene.add(group);\n\n                // Materials\n                const platformMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x111111, roughness: 0.8, metalness: 0.2 });\n                const coreMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x00E5FF, emissive: 0x00E5FF, emissiveIntensity: 0.8, roughness: 0.2 });\n                const wireMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x333333, transparent: true, opacity: 0.5 });\n\n                function addWireframe(mesh) {\n                    const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(mesh.geometry);\n                    const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, wireMat);\n                    mesh.add(line);\n                }\n\n                // Base\n                const baseGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(16, 0.5, 16);\n                const baseMesh = new THREE.Mesh(baseGeo, platformMat);\n                baseMesh.position.y = -3;\n                addWireframe(baseMesh);\n                group.add(baseMesh);\n\n                // Mid Tier\n                const midGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(8, 1.5, 8);\n                const midMesh = new THREE.Mesh(midGeo, platformMat);\n                midMesh.position.y = -2;\n                addWireframe(midMesh);\n                group.add(midMesh);\n\n                // Central Core\n                const coreGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(3, 5, 3);\n                const coreMesh = new THREE.Mesh(coreGeo, coreMat);\n                coreMesh.position.y = 1;\n                group.add(coreMesh);\n\n                // Holographic Rings\n                for(let i=0; i<4; i++) {\n                    const ringGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(6 + i*1.8, 6 + i*1.8, 0.1, 16, 1, true);\n                    const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(ringGeo);\n                    const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                        color: 0x00E5FF, transparent: true, opacity: 0.2 - (i * 0.04)\n                    }));\n                    line.position.y = 0.5 + i*1.5;\n                    group.add(line);\n                }\n\n                // Data Nodes\n                const nodes = [];\n                for(let i=0; i<15; i++) {\n                    const isEmissive = Math.random() > 0.6;\n                    const nodeMesh = new THREE.Mesh(\n                        new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.6, 0.6, 0.6), \n                        isEmissive ? coreMat : platformMat\n                    );\n                    \n                    const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                    const radius = 7 + Math.random() * 5;\n                    nodeMesh.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * radius, (Math.random() * 8) - 2, Math.sin(angle) * radius);\n                    \n                    if(!isEmissive) addWireframe(nodeMesh);\n                    \n                    nodes.push({\n                        mesh: nodeMesh,\n                        startY: nodeMesh.position.y,\n                        offset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n                        speed: 0.015 + Math.random() * 0.02\n                    });\n                    group.add(nodeMesh);\n                }\n\n                // Lighting\n                scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.4));\n                const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 0.8);\n                dirLight.position.set(10, 20, 10);\n                scene.add(dirLight);\n\n                const pointLight = new THREE.PointLight(0x00E5FF, 2.0, 25);\n                pointLight.position.set(0, 2, 0);\n                scene.add(pointLight);\n\n                // Animation\n                let time = 0;\n                function animate() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.01;\n\n                    group.rotation.y = Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 0.05 + time * 0.05;\n\n                    const pulse = (Math.sin(time * 3) + 1) * 0.5;\n                    coreMat.emissiveIntensity = 0.4 + pulse * 0.6;\n                    pointLight.intensity = 1.0 + pulse * 1.5;\n\n                    nodes.forEach(n => {\n                        n.mesh.position.y = n.startY + Math.sin(time * n.speed * 100 + n.offset) * 0.6;\n                        n.mesh.rotation.x += 0.005;\n                        n.mesh.rotation.y += 0.005;\n                    });\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n\n                // Resize handler\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!container) return;\n                    const w = container.clientWidth;\n                    const h = container.clientHeight;\n                    const a = w / h;\n                    camera.left = -d * a;\n                    camera.right = d * a;\n                    camera.top = d;\n                    camera.bottom = -d;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(w, h);\n                });\n\n                animate();\n            }\n\n            // Init ThreeJS\n            if (document.readyState === 'complete') {\n                initThreeJS();\n            } else {\n                window.addEventListener('load', initThreeJS);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "novus-capital-solutions-hero.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/novus-capital-solutions-hero.jpg", "source_name": "novus-capital-solutions-hero-DESIGN.md", "views": 96, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-28T20:04:44.699946+00:00"}